    },
    {
      "id": "e10",
      "time_offset_ms": 163066,
      "type": "zoom_result",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {},
      "narration": "A-I's your co-pilot, not your pilot. It'll never raise its hand and say hey, I forgot a filter. You've gotta know enough S-Q-L to read what it wrote. And that starts with knowing what WHERE does.",
